sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户(前端)
    participant C as CALL_FN/HTTP
    participant F as 云函数 data-api
    participant S as 云存储
    participant M as MySQL

    Note over U,M: 上传遗像
    U->>U: 选图→压缩(≤2048/5MB)→Canvas黑白化→base64
    U->>C: uploadPortrait {token, data.image}
    C->>F: HTTP POST
    F->>F: parseToken→解码Buffer→校验
    F->>S: uploadFile(cloudPath)
    S-->>F: fileID
    F->>S: getTempFileURL
    S-->>F: tempURL
    F->>M: INSERT portrait
    M-->>F: id
    F-->>U: {id,file_id,url,width,height,size}

    Note over U,M: 新增遗体（选遗照可空）
    U->>F: createRemain {token, data{name,gender,age,cause,portrait_id?,...}}
    F->>F: 校验；portrait_id非空则查portrait存在
    F->>M: INSERT remains
    M-->>F: id
    F-->>U: {id}

    Note over U,M: 删除遗像（非级联，引用置NULL）
    U->>F: deletePortrait {token, id}
    F->>M: SELECT portrait WHERE id
    F->>S: deleteFile(fileID)
    F->>M: DELETE portrait WHERE id
    F->>M: UPDATE remains SET portrait_id=NULL WHERE portrait_id=id
    F-->>U: {removed:true}
